      "text": "The transfer to the airport takes about **1 hour**. Fly to Buenos Aires.\n\nOn arrival, transfer with an English-speaking guide to the **Four Seasons Buenos Aires**, about **40 minutes** away. Stay in a city-view room with breakfast.\n\nBuenos Aires rounds off the nature-focused itinerary with architecture, historic neighbourhoods, restaurants and tango."
