      "sourceTextSha256": "a24e461dad09ec220743aa1b8601bda6a714073c580c6c5971eabfeec275aa35",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw9gazv7-ubl7s2pl6r",
        "model": "ChatGPT Codex"
      },
      "text": "In the morning, take a sightseeing tour with an English-speaking guide, lasting about **3 hours**.\n\nYou’ll see a commemorative obelisk, the La Boca neighbourhood and historic San Telmo with its cafés and restaurants. At Plaza Dorrego, you can browse antiques.\n\nYour guide will tell you about Evita Perón and the Casa Rosada, or Pink House. The daytime tour ends in colourful La Boca.\n\nLunch featuring Argentinian meat at a local restaurant is available at an additional cost.\n\n**Tango Show in Buenos Aires**\n\nThe transfer to the evening programme is included."
